WARNING: MALICIOUS TEST FIXTURES
================================

Everything under fixtures/malicious/ is intentionally hostile security-test
material.  Run it only through the SkillSentry sandbox and never execute it on
a workstation.

The C2 domains used here are fictional and unreachable outside the test
sinkhole: evil-collector.net and evil-c2.com.  The "credentials" are generated
canaries placed in the sandbox home directory; no real secrets are included.

fixtures/ is excluded from packaging.  Do not import, curl, or copy these
scripts into anything that can reach the public internet.
